{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46825","headline":"酬西蜀广济大师见寄 · 齐己","name":"酬西蜀广济大师见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犹得吾师继颂声，百篇相爱寄南荆。\n卷开锦水霞光烂，吟入峨嵋雪气清。\n楚外已甘推绝唱，蜀中谁敢共悬衡。\n应怜无可同无本，终向风骚作弟兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}